    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まさか、校舎の外にいるなんてね。気が付かなかったよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「てっきり、校舎のどこかにいると思って、いろんな部屋に行ってみたんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ううん。ちゃんと隠れる範囲を決めてなかったのが悪いから。気にしないで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そういえば……前に、ひまわり畑で『かくれんぼ』したこと覚えてる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あのときも、君は畑の外のほうにある……用具小屋のあたりに隠れてたんだよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そのことを思い出して、このあたりまで来たんだけど。当てが外れなくてよかったよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ねぇ……だいぶ昔、一緒に高原に行ったのを覚えてる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしと君で、坂を登って、高いところへ行って……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そこで、質問に答えなかったら、口にビスケットを詰める、ってやったよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あのとき、君は最初の質問にも答えなくて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「のどにビスケットがつかえて、大変なことになっちゃったけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「今なら、答えてくれるんじゃないかな、なんて思って」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君にはあのとき……好きなひとが、いたのかな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あはは。ちょっと昔のことが気になっただけ。別に、何を答えても、どうってことないよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「うん……？　やっぱり答えてくれないんだ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「じゃあ、ちょっと待って！　当ててみるから！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「たとえば……小学校のとき同じクラスだった、ののかちゃんとか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「違うのかぁ……それじゃ、みーこちゃんとか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「それも違う……あっ、話題をそらそうとしてるね？　いつもはあまり喋らないのに、露骨だなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ま、しかたないよね。誰にだって、知られたくない秘密は、あるものだから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「それに、雨に降られた日……わたしは君に、海に連れていってもらったね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「雨が降ったあとの海って、不思議な色をしてたよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「雲間から、光が差し込んで……海の底が、見えちゃいそうなくらいに輝いてて」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「夏は、わたしの季節なのに。夏の景色はぜんぶ、きれいなのに……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君だけが、ハサミで切り取ったみたいにいなくなっちゃうなんて、あのときは信じられなかった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君がいなくなったら、って考えると……止まらなくて。悲しくなっちゃって、泣いちゃったりもしたっけ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あのときのことも、覚えてる？　涙……拭いてくれたよね。泣かないで、って」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしはきっと、あのとき。君のことが……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「なんて言ったか、聞こえなかったの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「きっと、波の音でかき消されちゃったんだね。昔、ふたりで見たときの、あの海が……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ううん、なんでもない。ただのひとりごと」"
  },
  {
